            "review_title": "Review at Bia Hai Xom Draught Beer",
            "review_text": "ChrisSeattle_wa\nseattle,wa254 contributions\n0\nBia Hoi\nNov 2015 • Couples\nFantastic locals spot. Loud, boisterous. Working men out for beer. My wife and I were the only Westerners there and everyone seemed to enjoy that ( she was the only female there not serving). Food and snacks available. Beer is cold and quaffable but really pretty bad - but \"when in Rome...\". 5 beers, 1 plate of peanuts, two napkins, and meeting a couple new friends cost us just under $3USD. Before hitting that Aussie bar, grab a beer with a local first.\nRead more\nWritten November 4, 2015",
